<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="heading">同城小队</view><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><button class="btn soft small" data-url="/pages/team-editor/index" bindtap="go">筹建小队</button><view class="notice mt">3–100人，周期7–365天，至少2项任务。挑战中可加入、退出，按实际在队日期核验。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="card mt"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.city}} · {{item.start}} 至 {{item.end}}</view><view>{{item.members.length}}/{{item.max}}人 · {{item.launched ? "挑战中" : "筹队中"}}</view><button class="btn soft mt" data-url="/pages/team-detail/index?id={{item.id}}" bindtap="go">查看小队</button></view></block></view>